# AI Customer Support Automation

**Capstone Project (Option 1) — AI Automation Internship**
**Petalnex Pvt. Ltd.** | Intern: Sajeel Ali

An n8n workflow that takes in client support requests for Petalnex's software, AI, and automation projects, classifies and prioritizes them with Google Gemini, and — once complete — will ground suggested responses in a real knowledge base and keep a human in the loop before anything is sent.

This is Petalnex's **second** capstone project, built after completing the AI Recruitment Automation project ahead of schedule. It reuses the same design principles: AI only where reasoning is genuinely needed, deterministic rules everywhere else, and a human always makes the final call on anything beyond routine.

